WEBVTT

00:07.690 --> 00:08.900
<b><i>Magic.</i></b>

00:09.900 --> 00:12.280
<b><i>Technology that modifies
bodies of information...</i></b>

00:12.610 --> 00:14.950
<b><i>and changes phenomena.</i></b>

00:15.910 --> 00:17.740
<b><i>A power...</i></b>

00:17.740 --> 00:19.490
<b><i>that can change the world.</i></b>

00:21.580 --> 00:25.330
<b><i>It can heal people and save their lives.</i></b>

00:26.630 --> 00:30.210
<b><i>It is even capable of destroying nations.</i></b>

00:33.840 --> 00:37.260
<b><i>The agent of change in an era
where stereotypes are defied...</i></b>

00:37.930 --> 00:42.180
<b><i>Those who used magic
came to be known as "magicians."</i></b>

00:43.060 --> 00:44.520
<b><i>But...</i></b>

00:44.520 --> 00:47.770
<b><i>now that nearly a century has passed since then...</i></b>

00:47.770 --> 00:49.150
<b><i>the magicians' blood relatives...</i></b>

00:49.940 --> 00:52.690
<b><i>are bound by various restraints.</i></b>

00:53.780 --> 00:58.780
<b><i>And the Yotsuba Family, who rule
over the Ten Master Clans, are no exception.</i></b>

00:59.700 --> 01:01.910
<b><i>It is also a curse.</i></b>

01:02.490 --> 01:03.910
<b><i>For me, as well.</i></b>

01:05.290 --> 01:06.920
<b>NOVEMBER 6, A.D. 2095</b>

01:24.520 --> 01:26.060
<b>Don't worry.</b>

01:26.060 --> 01:29.190
<b>You and I aren't who we were
three years ago.</b>

01:31.440 --> 01:33.190
<b>Brother...</b>

01:36.030 --> 01:37.280
<b><i>That's right.</i></b>

01:37.280 --> 01:40.570
<b><i>Yes, we are different from three years ago...</i></b>

01:45.330 --> 01:47.710
<b><i>My relationship with Brother...</i></b>

01:49.080 --> 01:51.000
<b><i>and my feelings...</i></b>

01:51.670 --> 01:53.630
<b><i>for him, as well.</i></b>

01:56.170 --> 01:59.720
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL</b>

02:12.060 --> 02:14.690
<b>APRIL 6, A.D. 2096
FIRST DAY OF
THE NEW SCHOOL YEAR</b>

02:22.240 --> 02:23.700
<b>Morning!</b>

02:25.290 --> 02:26.500
<b>Hey!</b>

02:27.750 --> 02:29.080
<b>Mikihiko...</b>

02:29.080 --> 02:31.630
<b>How does it feel
to be wearing a Course 1 uniform?</b>

02:33.130 --> 02:35.340
<b>Don't tease me like that, Tatsuya.</b>

02:35.670 --> 02:37.050
<b>What about you, Tatsuya?</b>

02:37.050 --> 02:39.970
<b>Feeling comfortable
in that Magical Engineering uniform?</b>

02:39.970 --> 02:43.760
<b>It may be new,
but right now it's only a title.</b>

02:43.760 --> 02:45.220
<b>Come on, zero excitement?</b>

02:45.970 --> 02:46.970
<b>You said it!</b>

02:47.350 --> 02:50.560
<b>Look at Mizuki!
Could that grin be any wider?</b>

02:50.560 --> 02:53.270
<b>I-I'm not grinning, all right?</b>

02:53.270 --> 02:55.610
<b>You don't need to act tough!</b>

02:59.780 --> 03:03.120
<b>You're sitting next to Tatsuya
again this year, huh?</b>

03:03.450 --> 03:06.950
<b>Maybe I should've applied for a transfer
to Magical Engineering myself!</b>

03:06.950 --> 03:10.000
<b>No need for that.
Our classroom's right next door.</b>

03:10.000 --> 03:11.580
<b>That's right.</b>

03:11.580 --> 03:15.040
<b>It's not like other classrooms
are off-limits, right?</b>

03:15.040 --> 03:18.460
<b>It's just that we're attending class
in different rooms, isn't it?</b>

03:18.460 --> 03:20.130
<b>You do have a point there!</b>

03:20.590 --> 03:21.930
<b>Hey, do you have a second?</b>

03:21.930 --> 03:24.760
<b>I don't think I've properly
introduced myself to you yet.</b>

03:25.140 --> 03:27.010
<b>I'm Hagane Tomitsuka.</b>

03:27.010 --> 03:28.930
<b>Nice to meet you, Shiba.</b>

03:29.350 --> 03:31.940
<b>Right. Nice to meet you, Tomitsuka.</b>

03:32.230 --> 03:35.810
<b><i>The maverick of the Tomitsuka Family,
one of the most powerful of the Hundred Families.</i></b>

03:36.150 --> 03:37.820
<b><i>Also known as "Range Zero."</i></b>

03:38.110 --> 03:39.530
<b>Who knew?</b>

03:39.530 --> 03:43.450
<b>You're ranked Number 5 overall in our grade,
and you joined Magical Engineering?</b>

03:43.740 --> 03:48.080
<b>This is more my family's specialty
than combat or rescue...</b>

03:48.080 --> 03:51.210
<b>and also, I have a defect
when it comes to practical skills.</b>

03:51.580 --> 03:52.960
<b><i>"Range Zero."</i></b>

03:53.290 --> 03:56.960
<b><i>Not only does it mean that he boasts
invincible power at zero distance...</i></b>

03:56.960 --> 03:59.460
<b><i>but it also refers to his inability
to use distance magic.</i></b>

03:59.460 --> 04:02.470
<b><i>It's both a term of respect
and of contempt.</i></b>

04:02.880 --> 04:05.390
<b>Everyone has their strengths
and their weaknesses.</b>

04:05.390 --> 04:07.850
<b>It sounds really convincing
coming from you, Tatsuya.</b>

04:10.980 --> 04:13.390
<b>Tomitsuka! Found you!</b>

04:13.890 --> 04:15.100
<b>Ms. Akechi?</b>

04:15.100 --> 04:17.110
<b>Morning, Tomitsuka!</b>

04:17.650 --> 04:19.230
<b>And good morning to you, too, Shiba!</b>

04:19.230 --> 04:20.400
<b>Morning, Eimi.</b>

04:20.400 --> 04:22.610
<b>Oh, uh, morning, Ms. Akechi.</b>

04:23.110 --> 04:26.530
<b>Why won't you call me "Eimi," Tomitsuka?</b>

04:26.530 --> 04:28.280
<b>Shiba calls me by my first name!</b>

04:28.280 --> 04:32.250
<b>Huh? But you call me "Tomitsuka."</b>

04:32.250 --> 04:35.920
<b>What, you'd rather I called you "Hagane," too?</b>

04:35.920 --> 04:38.210
<b>Oh, come on! Why didn't you tell me sooner?</b>

04:38.210 --> 04:42.050
<b>Well, um, that's really not my point, see...</b>

04:42.630 --> 04:45.550
<b>Ms. Akechi, let's pick this up
again another time!</b>

04:48.350 --> 04:49.560
<b>Really...</b>

04:49.560 --> 04:52.430
<b>Eimi, shouldn't you go after him?</b>

04:52.430 --> 04:55.230
<b>I don't think backing off is an option here!</b>

04:56.730 --> 04:57.730
<b>Okay!</b>

04:57.730 --> 05:00.230
<b>Tomitsuka!</b>

05:00.230 --> 05:03.240
<b>- M-M-Ms. Akechi!
- Come on, let's talk some more!</b>

05:09.990 --> 05:13.000
<b>STUDENT COUNCIL OFFICE</b>

05:11.330 --> 05:13.370
<b>Um, as of today...</b>

05:13.370 --> 05:18.790
<b>we'll be launching the Student Council and
Disciplinary Committee for the first half of 2096.</b>

05:18.790 --> 05:22.000
<b>First off, we have some new members,
so let me announce them.</b>

05:22.710 --> 05:28.390
<b>Tatsuya Shiba has newly joined
the Student Council as its vice chairman!</b>

05:28.390 --> 05:30.140
<b>I look forward to working with you all.</b>

05:30.430 --> 05:35.270
<b>And Yoshida and Ms. Kitayama are
the Disciplinary Committee's newest members.</b>

05:35.940 --> 05:37.020
<b>I look...</b>

05:39.100 --> 05:41.150
<b>- I look forward to working with you all.
- I look forward to working with you all.</b>

05:42.400 --> 05:48.240
<b>All right, today we'll be discussing our plans for
the matriculation ceremony the day after tomorrow.</b>

05:48.240 --> 05:52.620
<b>Meaning that the representative of this year's
incoming class will also be taking part?</b>

05:52.950 --> 05:56.250
<b>Yes! He should be here any minute now!</b>

05:57.540 --> 05:59.500
<b>Oh, it looks like he's here!</b>

05:59.960 --> 06:01.130
<b>Come in!</b>

06:01.670 --> 06:03.380
<b>Excuse me.</b>

06:07.090 --> 06:08.380
<b>Let me introduce him to you.</b>

06:09.090 --> 06:14.390
<b>This is Takuma Shippou,
the representative of this year's incoming class.</b>

06:15.470 --> 06:17.850
<b>I'm Tatsuya Shiba, the vice chairman.</b>

06:20.060 --> 06:22.730
<b>I'm Takuma Shippou.</b>

06:22.730 --> 06:24.860
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

06:31.030 --> 06:33.490
<b>Shippou?</b>

06:34.240 --> 06:35.620
<b>Pardon me.</b>

06:35.620 --> 06:40.710
<b>It's just that I've never seen
that gear emblem on Mr. Shiba's uniform.</b>

06:41.040 --> 06:46.960
<b>Oh! That's the emblem of the Magical Engineering
Course, which was just created this year!</b>

06:48.090 --> 06:50.340
<b>Oh, is that right?</b>

06:53.760 --> 06:55.680
<b>Like my big brother...</b>

06:56.180 --> 06:59.190
<b>I am your vice chairman, Miyuki Shiba.</b>

07:02.270 --> 07:04.230
<b>I'm Takuma Shippou.</b>

07:04.230 --> 07:06.320
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

07:12.990 --> 07:13.820
<b>Still...</b>

07:14.370 --> 07:17.330
<b>I never thought it would turn
into a glaring contest off the bat.</b>

07:17.330 --> 07:21.710
<b>It seems like the Shippous' eldest son
has a belligerent streak, don't you think?</b>

07:21.710 --> 07:26.210
<b>His behavior toward you, Brother,
was altogether too disrespectful.</b>

07:26.500 --> 07:28.840
<b>Due to their hostility
toward the Saegusa Clan...</b>

07:29.130 --> 07:32.090
<b>the Shippous are said to be more obsessed...</b>

07:32.090 --> 07:35.800
<b>than the other 18 Assistant Families
with the Ten Master Clans.</b>

07:38.020 --> 07:43.020
<b>Shippou must want to prove that he has
powers worthy of the Ten Master Clans.</b>

07:43.850 --> 07:47.860
<b>It seems like that has led to a tendency
to look down on those without power, too.</b>

07:48.440 --> 07:52.610
<b>Actually, it's more like he has
no interest in them.</b>

07:52.610 --> 07:57.280
<b>I'm sure that your abilities
are known far and wide, Brother.</b>

07:57.620 --> 08:00.160
<b>You overestimate me, Miyuki.</b>

08:00.160 --> 08:05.170
<b>At most, the only ones who know about me
are those with ties to the magic high schools.</b>

08:05.170 --> 08:09.090
<b>You can't blame Shippou, who was just a junior high
student until recently, for not knowing who I am.</b>

08:10.590 --> 08:12.630
<b>Are you sure about that?</b>

08:14.010 --> 08:19.010
<b>That being said, it's true that Shippou's
attitude just now was deplorable.</b>

08:19.010 --> 08:22.020
<b>He'll probably cause some friction
one of these days.</b>

08:24.440 --> 08:25.980
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
DOUBLE SEVEN PART I</b>

08:26.770 --> 08:31.240
<b>NATIONAL MAGIC
UNIVERSITY AFFILIATED
FIRST HIGH SCHOOL</b>

08:26.770 --> 08:32.360
<b><i>Today is the day of the matriculation ceremony for the
National Magic University Affiliated First High School.</i></b>

08:31.240 --> 08:33.360
<b>MATRICULATION
CEREMONY</b>

08:32.360 --> 08:35.990
<b>APRIL 8, A.D. 2096</b>

08:32.650 --> 08:39.490
<b><i>Incoming students, guests and parents,
please gather in the auditorium.</i></b>

08:48.130 --> 08:49.750
<b>Oh my, Tatsuya!</b>

08:51.880 --> 08:53.720
<b>Ms. Saegusa?</b>

08:53.720 --> 08:55.050
<b>Good morning.</b>

08:55.680 --> 08:56.760
<b>Long time no see.</b>

08:57.220 --> 08:58.930
<b>It sounds strange, doesn't it?</b>

08:58.930 --> 09:00.640
<b>Are you helping the new students?</b>

09:00.640 --> 09:01.600
<b>Yes.</b>

09:01.600 --> 09:02.640
<b>Well...</b>

09:03.350 --> 09:06.600
<b>It hasn't even been a month
since graduation...</b>

09:06.600 --> 09:09.480
<b>but I almost didn't recognize you, Tatsuya!</b>

09:10.070 --> 09:11.650
<b>Is that right?</b>

09:11.650 --> 09:16.410
<b>Yes. That uniform's for
the Magical Engineering Course, isn't it?</b>

09:16.410 --> 09:18.660
<b>You're totally different than last year.</b>

09:18.660 --> 09:21.410
<b>I think it's just that my uniform changed.</b>

09:21.410 --> 09:22.540
<b>No.</b>

09:22.950 --> 09:28.920
<b>Today, you're nothing like the Tatsuya
I met last year for the first time.</b>

09:29.380 --> 09:33.010
<b>You look as if you're a lot freer than last year.</b>

09:34.130 --> 09:35.550
<b>I surrender.</b>

09:35.550 --> 09:38.010
<b>When it comes to yourself,
you can never tell, right?</b>

09:40.390 --> 09:44.640
<b>Speaking of unrecognizable,
you've changed quite a lot yourself.</b>

09:44.980 --> 09:46.350
<b>What? Really?</b>

09:46.350 --> 09:48.520
<b>Yes. You're a college student
through and through now.</b>

09:49.150 --> 09:51.270
<b>You seem very mature to me.</b>

09:51.270 --> 09:53.280
<b>Almost like a different person.</b>

09:54.240 --> 09:55.860
<b>I don't know about that!</b>

09:56.280 --> 09:57.030
<b>Hey...</b>

09:57.400 --> 10:00.410
<b>Tatsuya, just what do you mean by that?</b>

10:00.740 --> 10:02.540
<b>What do I mean by what?</b>

10:03.080 --> 10:06.080
<b>Mature like a different person...</b>

10:06.410 --> 10:09.920
<b>Is that your way of telling me
that I looked childish before?</b>

10:09.920 --> 10:11.630
<b>You're overthinking it.</b>

10:11.630 --> 10:14.760
<b>I've never once thought
that you were baby-faced...</b>

10:14.760 --> 10:18.630
<b>or had the physique of an infant.</b>

10:19.470 --> 10:20.720
<b>"Baby-faced"!</b>

10:20.720 --> 10:22.300
<b>"Physique of an infant"!</b>

10:22.680 --> 10:24.010
<b>Are you feeling unwell?</b>

10:24.430 --> 10:26.270
<b>No, I'm fine!</b>

10:29.480 --> 10:32.360
<b>Anyway, Tatsuya,
what do you mean, "a different person"?</b>

10:32.360 --> 10:34.730
<b>I really didn't mean anything in particular.</b>

10:34.730 --> 10:36.490
<b>That was just idiomatic rhetoric.</b>

10:36.490 --> 10:40.240
<b>Really? It didn't seem that way to me!</b>

10:40.240 --> 10:41.240
<b>Hey you!</b>

10:43.030 --> 10:46.000
<b>Get away from my big sis, you womanizer!</b>

10:46.000 --> 10:47.500
<b>Kasumi?</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:48.960
<b>Oh! I'm sorry!</b>

10:54.300 --> 10:55.960
<b>Th-Thank you.</b>

10:55.960 --> 10:58.050
<b>I said get away from her!</b>

10:58.590 --> 11:01.220
<b>Didn't you hear me?</b>

11:13.270 --> 11:16.110
<b><i>The magic sequence remains
perfectly aligned with her body...</i></b>

11:16.110 --> 11:19.030
<b><i>with no degradation
of the data fortification wall.</i></b>

11:20.110 --> 11:24.950
<b><i>Normally, this would only occur
when one casts magic upon oneself.</i></b>

11:24.950 --> 11:26.830
<b><i>So, these two are the Saegusa twins, huh?</i></b>

11:27.290 --> 11:29.540
<b>Kasumi, are you okay?</b>

11:29.540 --> 11:33.250
<b>Izumi, for a womanizer, this guy's strong!</b>

11:33.250 --> 11:36.210
<b>Kasumi, I think you need to calm down.</b>

11:36.210 --> 11:38.460
<b>My gut is screaming out to me!</b>

11:38.460 --> 11:40.090
<b>This guy's not just anyone!</b>

11:41.220 --> 11:42.970
<b>Enough is enough!</b>

11:43.430 --> 11:45.890
<b>Big Sister, where did that come from?</b>

11:45.890 --> 11:48.220
<b>Right back at you!</b>

11:48.220 --> 11:50.640
<b>Kasumi, where did that come from?</b>

11:51.020 --> 11:54.770
<b>B-But that guy was just about to do
something nasty to you, so...</b>

11:55.360 --> 11:58.030
<b>What? N-Nasty?</b>

11:58.480 --> 12:01.110
<b>We were doing no such thing!</b>

12:01.110 --> 12:03.410
<b>What are you even thinking anyway?</b>

12:03.410 --> 12:06.030
<b>Hey, I think that's enough, Ms. Saegusa.</b>

12:06.830 --> 12:08.040
<b>Tatsuya...</b>

12:08.540 --> 12:09.790
<b>- I'm so sorry.
- Hey!</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:12.540
<b>My little sister's behavior was outrageous.</b>

12:12.870 --> 12:16.250
<b>Kasumi, you apologize to Tatsuya, too.</b>

12:17.920 --> 12:20.260
<b>I am very sorry for what I did.</b>

12:20.550 --> 12:23.090
<b>Let me apologize, too.</b>

12:23.090 --> 12:24.430
<b>Mr. Shiba...</b>

12:24.430 --> 12:27.260
<b>Please forgive Kasumi for being so rude.</b>

12:28.220 --> 12:31.140
<b>Please look up now, all three of you.</b>

12:31.560 --> 12:35.350
<b>As nothing happened in the end,
I'm not going to worry about it anymore.</b>

12:35.730 --> 12:40.110
<b>Not to mention, I knew from the start
that you were planning to stop right before impact.</b>

12:40.110 --> 12:41.530
<b>How?</b>

12:42.530 --> 12:44.570
<b>Impressive as always, Tatsuya.</b>

12:45.070 --> 12:46.240
<b>Brother!</b>

12:46.870 --> 12:48.950
<b>So, this is where you've been.</b>

12:48.950 --> 12:49.870
<b>Miyuki...</b>

12:49.870 --> 12:53.660
<b>Ms. Saegusa, what brings you here today?</b>

12:53.660 --> 12:56.670
<b>Oh, well, I'm chaperoning my sisters.</b>

12:56.670 --> 13:00.550
<b>Kasumi, Izumi, say hello to Ms. Miyuki.</b>

13:03.170 --> 13:04.880
<b>Izumi?</b>

13:12.850 --> 13:15.390
<b>Izumi? Hey, Izumi?</b>

13:15.390 --> 13:16.310
<b>Uh...</b>

13:16.310 --> 13:17.270
<b>Yes?</b>

13:17.270 --> 13:20.770
<b>What do you mean, "yes"?
Give Ms. Miyuki a proper greeting.</b>

13:26.280 --> 13:28.410
<b>She's like a goddess!</b>

13:28.910 --> 13:30.830
<b>I'm Izumi Saegusa!</b>

13:30.830 --> 13:34.710
<b>Um, may I call you "Ms. Miyuki"?</b>

13:35.000 --> 13:37.210
<b>Yes. That would be fine with me.</b>

13:37.540 --> 13:41.130
<b>Ms. Miyuki, I had the privilege of watching
your heroics during the Nine Schools Competition!</b>

13:41.130 --> 13:42.460
<b>You were so amazing!</b>

13:42.760 --> 13:43.840
<b>Thank you!</b>

13:43.840 --> 13:46.180
<b>But now that I'm seeing you in person,</b>

13:46.180 --> 13:49.140
<b>compared to seeing you from the stands,
you're a hundred times more beautiful!</b>

13:49.140 --> 13:50.850
<b>I-Is that so?</b>

13:50.850 --> 13:55.600
<b>To think that I can attend the same school
as someone like you, Ms. Miyuki... I'm so thrilled!</b>

13:55.600 --> 14:00.110
<b>Ms. Miyuki, would you kindly become
my big sister?</b>

14:02.610 --> 14:03.730
<b>Big sister?</b>

14:03.730 --> 14:07.320
<b>Hey, Izumi! Calm down!
I'm your big sister, remember?</b>

14:10.070 --> 14:14.450
<b>I believe that it would be impossible for you
to become Big Sister Miyuki's little sister.</b>

14:14.450 --> 14:15.580
<b>Minami...</b>

14:16.000 --> 14:19.710
<b>You could become
Big Brother Tatsuya's little sister.</b>

14:19.960 --> 14:24.090
<b>If your own big sister
were to marry Big Brother Tatsuya...</b>

14:24.340 --> 14:28.680
<b>then you would become
Big Brother Tatsuya's sister-in-law.</b>

14:29.760 --> 14:31.350
<b>Minami, what are you talking—</b>

14:31.350 --> 14:32.760
<b>I'm totally against that!</b>

14:32.760 --> 14:37.270
<b>I'm totally against Big Sister becoming
Mr. Shiba's bride, no matter what!</b>

14:37.270 --> 14:42.440
<b>This is a golden opportunity to have Ms. Miyuki
become my big sister even if we're just in-laws!</b>

14:42.440 --> 14:46.320
<b>Sister, please marry Mr. Shiba!</b>

14:44.150 --> 14:48.610
<b>- Please, please consider it!
- Absolutely not!</b>

14:49.950 --> 14:55.540
<b>Seriously... I'm truly sorry
that I have such fools for little sisters!</b>

14:56.370 --> 14:58.080
<b>It doesn't bother us.</b>

14:58.410 --> 15:00.210
<b>Right, Miyuki?</b>

15:00.210 --> 15:04.130
<b>Right. Ms. Saegusa,
please don't give it another thought.</b>

15:04.630 --> 15:07.380
<b>I promise to make it up to you!</b>

15:07.380 --> 15:09.630
<b>You two, we're leaving now!</b>

15:09.630 --> 15:11.640
<b>I can't breathe, Big Sister!</b>

15:11.640 --> 15:13.510
<b>Sister, that hurts!</b>

15:13.510 --> 15:16.430
<b>Why are you treating me like this, too?</b>

15:16.430 --> 15:19.100
<b>The matriculation ceremony's about to start.</b>

15:19.100 --> 15:21.520
<b>Let's head back to the auditorium.</b>

15:54.550 --> 15:57.850
<b>Come to think of it,
how'd recruiting the top kid go?</b>

15:58.180 --> 15:59.350
<b>It didn't work out.</b>

15:59.350 --> 16:02.730
<b>What? Shippou turned down the chance
to join the student council?</b>

16:03.310 --> 16:06.980
<b>I hear that he said he wanted
to devote his time to club activities.</b>

16:06.980 --> 16:10.740
<b>Since there's something else he wants to do,
we'll just have to live with it.</b>

16:10.740 --> 16:13.240
<b>Yeah, not like we can force him.</b>

16:13.530 --> 16:20.250
<b>It'd be more constructive to think
about whom to recruit in Shippou's place, right?</b>

16:20.620 --> 16:24.790
<b>I know! What about adding Minami
to the council?</b>

16:24.790 --> 16:28.250
<b>Miyuki, that would be too hard on Minami.</b>

16:28.250 --> 16:31.470
<b>Since the top student's always been asked
to join the student council...</b>

16:31.470 --> 16:35.640
<b>we need to select the replacement candidate
based on their entrance exam scores, as well.</b>

16:36.600 --> 16:38.350
<b>Who came in second?</b>

16:38.350 --> 16:41.020
<b>Um, that would be Izumi Saegusa.</b>

16:41.020 --> 16:43.390
<b>Ms. Saegusa's little sister.</b>

16:43.690 --> 16:46.230
<b>And Kasumi Saegusa came in third.</b>

16:46.230 --> 16:52.030
<b>Shippou and those two
were Number 1, 2 and 3, each by a hair.</b>

16:59.790 --> 17:01.120
<b>Come in!</b>

17:03.080 --> 17:05.290
<b>We're coming in, Nakajo.</b>

17:05.290 --> 17:07.250
<b>What are you two doing here?</b>

17:07.250 --> 17:08.960
<b>The Disciplinary Committee...</b>

17:08.960 --> 17:11.920
<b>and the Extracurricular Activities Federation
would like to scout some new students, too.</b>

17:11.920 --> 17:14.300
<b>We don't want to fight over them
with the student council...</b>

17:14.300 --> 17:15.890
<b>so we came to consult you.</b>

17:16.220 --> 17:17.890
<b>She's right.</b>

17:17.890 --> 17:21.060
<b>The Extracurricular Activities Federation
would like to recruit Shippou.</b>

17:21.350 --> 17:25.560
<b>But then, we'd be more or less stealing him
away from the student council, so...</b>

17:25.980 --> 17:30.070
<b>He's already turned us down,
so we won't see it as stealing!</b>

17:30.070 --> 17:32.190
<b>Really? We owe you one.</b>

17:33.320 --> 17:35.450
<b>Don't worry about a thing!</b>

17:35.820 --> 17:37.910
<b>What's the student council going to do?</b>

17:37.910 --> 17:41.240
<b>Right, well, they all seem really competent—</b>

17:41.240 --> 17:44.370
<b>No need to make it complicated, right?</b>

17:44.370 --> 17:48.630
<b>If you recruited the top student and got turned down,
then you just have to pick the Number 2 student.</b>

17:48.630 --> 17:50.210
<b>This year, that would be...</b>

17:50.210 --> 17:50.920
<b>What?</b>

17:50.920 --> 17:52.590
<b>Oh!</b>

17:53.010 --> 17:55.590
<b>Oh!</b>

17:56.720 --> 17:59.090
<b>APRIL 10, A.D. 2096</b>

17:58.050 --> 17:59.090
<b>Does this mean...</b>

17:59.430 --> 18:05.100
<b>that you're going to appoint one of us
as a member of the student council?</b>

18:05.430 --> 18:08.600
<b>If you're motivated, we'll take both of you.</b>

18:08.940 --> 18:12.230
<b>I have not intention
of joining the student council!</b>

18:12.570 --> 18:16.150
<b>Then, Ms. Izumi,
will you join the student council?</b>

18:17.110 --> 18:18.410
<b>With pleasure!</b>

18:19.570 --> 18:20.870
<b>Kasumi!</b>

18:21.490 --> 18:23.990
<b>Why don't you join
the Disciplinary Committee?</b>

18:25.250 --> 18:30.630
<b>I bet you'd be no less productive
than Shiba was last year.</b>

18:31.130 --> 18:33.420
<b>You think that I'd...</b>

18:51.150 --> 18:51.900
<b>Sister...</b>

18:52.520 --> 18:54.400
<b>It looks like the target's here.</b>

18:55.190 --> 18:56.900
<b>I saw that, too.</b>

18:56.900 --> 18:59.240
<b>But a houseboat, of all things?</b>

18:59.240 --> 19:00.700
<b>It's so conspicuous.</b>

19:00.700 --> 19:02.450
<b>Are they even trying to hide it?</b>

19:02.780 --> 19:05.950
<b>I doubt they're motivated to hide it.
Even if someone sees them...</b>

19:06.450 --> 19:10.210
<b>all they have to say
is that they're giving some journalist info.</b>

19:10.210 --> 19:12.080
<b>A journalist, huh?</b>

19:12.590 --> 19:14.590
<b>It's so obvious that he's a mercenary.</b>

19:15.090 --> 19:18.340
<b>It seems like he does have
actual experience as a mercenary.</b>

19:18.340 --> 19:22.090
<b>I hear that he's a reporter
with strong antiestablishment tendencies.</b>

19:22.340 --> 19:23.760
<b>All right, let's do this.</b>

19:23.760 --> 19:25.350
<b>We'll start with the boat.</b>

19:25.350 --> 19:27.140
<b>Counting on you, Sister.</b>

19:27.520 --> 19:28.730
<b>I'm going to blast you.</b>

19:29.060 --> 19:30.100
<b>Okay.</b>

19:37.400 --> 19:38.490
<b>Who are you?</b>

19:40.740 --> 19:42.070
<b>A magician?</b>

19:48.330 --> 19:49.460
<b>You damn monster!</b>

20:08.970 --> 20:10.270
<b>Yami...</b>

20:10.270 --> 20:12.310
<b>Did you find out who they really are?</b>

20:13.480 --> 20:18.980
<b>The guys on the boat were members of
a humanist organization working for the USNA.</b>

20:18.980 --> 20:20.280
<b>What about the reporter?</b>

20:20.780 --> 20:23.280
<b>I found messages between him...</b>

20:23.280 --> 20:26.410
<b>and a minority senator
famous for hating magicians on his computer.</b>

20:26.410 --> 20:28.040
<b>I see.</b>

20:28.620 --> 20:32.370
<b>It looks like we'll have to dig
a little deeper into his background.</b>

20:32.750 --> 20:34.250
<b>I agree.</b>

20:57.730 --> 20:59.070
<b>Master.</b>

21:02.570 --> 21:04.530
<b>Gongjin...</b>

21:04.530 --> 21:06.570
<b>How did it go?</b>

21:06.570 --> 21:09.580
<b>Unfortunately, the assault on the
Progressive Human Front's offshore tower...</b>

21:09.870 --> 21:11.580
<b>ended in failure.</b>

21:11.580 --> 21:14.460
<b>All of our men have been captured.</b>

21:14.750 --> 21:18.670
<b>The ploy to publicize how the magicians
employed by the offshore tower...</b>

21:18.670 --> 21:23.130
<b>are being forced into slavery...</b>

21:23.130 --> 21:24.970
<b>Did that fail?</b>

21:25.300 --> 21:29.100
<b>Their role was merely to assist us,
nothing more.</b>

21:29.100 --> 21:31.720
<b>Our main objective
of manipulating the mass media...</b>

21:31.720 --> 21:35.600
<b>despite the reporter having been caught,
is proceeding apace.</b>

21:35.600 --> 21:38.650
<b>What's the rate of progress?</b>

21:39.060 --> 21:41.730
<b>40 percent of visual media...</b>

21:42.070 --> 21:45.610
<b>and about 30 percent of print media, I believe.</b>

21:46.200 --> 21:53.830
<b>Once the manipulation rate of the visual media
hits 50 percent, go all out.</b>

21:54.710 --> 22:00.290
<b>So that no politician who cares
about votes can bear to sit still.</b>

22:02.760 --> 22:04.800
<b>As you wish.</b>

23:36.310 --> 23:39.940
<b>THE IRREGULAR
AT MAGIC HIGH SCHOOL
DOUBLE SEVEN PART II</b>
